      "detail": "All nine election dates verified as Tuesdays. Seat count 8 holds across all 8 panel years (no redistricting, no size change). Every name is verbatim from a locally extracted PDF or a scraped city page - no summarizer text was trusted for a name. Two scheduled turnovers cross-checked in both directions: Riddick -> Paige (Ward 4) appears in the 2022-11-08 state canvass AND as the FY2022->FY2023 ACFR diff; McClellan -> McGee (SW6) and Royster -> Clanton (SW7) appear in the 2024-11-05 city canvass AND as the FY2024->FY2025 ACFR diff. Neither McClellan nor Royster appears on the 2024 ballot - both declined to seek re-election (New Journal & Guide). Vice Mayor Thomas named in all seven ACFR officials pages 2019-2025 and on the live page in 2026 - continuous."
    },
